Package: doorphone-hap
Version: 0.3.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), ffmpeg, adduser
Maintainer: Mitsuru Nakada <mitsuru_nakada@mac.com>
Description: HomeKit bridge for Panasonic VL-X70AH doorphone
 Exposes the Panasonic VL-X70AH (home intercom) as a HomeKit
 video doorbell + camera. Connects to the base via AWS KVS WebRTC
 and relays the H264 stream to Apple Home.
